{"fields":[{"t":"B","v":"false","n":"HasIntroAudio"},{"t":"A","v":"intro","n":"IntroAudio"},{"t":"B","v":"true","n":"HasPromptAudio"},{"t":"A","v":"prompt","n":"PromptAudio","s":"Quelles étaient les 6 armes originales du jeu de société [i]Cluedo[/i]?"},{"t":"B","v":"true","n":"HasClueAudio0"},{"t":"A","v":"answers_0_hint","n":"ClueAudio0","s":"Let's go people, take a stab at it."},{"t":"B","v":"true","n":"HasClueAudio1"},{"t":"A","v":"answers_1_hint","n":"ClueAudio1","s":"One weapon is a type of gun. And no, gun is not acceptable, c'mon!"},{"t":"B","v":"false","n":"HasClueAudio2"},{"t":"A","v":"answers_2_hint","n":"ClueAudio2"},{"t":"B","v":"true","n":"HasClueAudio3"},{"t":"A","v":"answers_3_hint","n":"ClueAudio3","s":"This one is good to have in your tool kit... of MURDER!"},{"t":"B","v":"false","n":"HasClueAudio4"},{"t":"A","v":"answers_4_hint","n":"ClueAudio4"},{"t":"B","v":"true","n":"HasClueAudio5"},{"t":"A","v":"answers_5_hint","n":"ClueAudio5","s":"One is made out of lead, and it's not lead paint. Though that's not good for you either."},{"t":"B","v":"false","n":"HasFollowupAudio"},{"t":"A","v":"followup","n":"FollowupAudio"},{"t":"B","v":"false","n":"HasOutroAudio"},{"t":"A","v":"outro","n":"OutroAudio"}]}
